      "description": "This 3-in-1 device features a 3-mode red flashlight, a hand warmer, and a portable power bank for recharging your personal electronics on the go. Whether you use it to light the way at an techx star party, a night walk, or wildlife research, ThermoTorch 3 Astro Red's rugged, IPX4-rated design will withstand your everyday activities.",
